    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP, in the Fight phase of either turn, right after an enemy unit picks its targets, aimed at a TYRANIDS unit of yours. Until the phase ends, roll a D6 each time a model of your unit that has not yet fought this phase is destroyed. If the result is 4+, the slain model stays on the battlefield for now: it may fight after the enemy unit has resolved all of its attacks, and is removed from play afterwards.",
